      "text": "Post\n\nPost\n\nThe White Helmets@SyriaCivilDefA person was killed in a missile strike by an unidentified drone on Tuesday, February 25, near the village of Al-Nasr, south of #Jarabulus in eastern rural #Aleppo.\n\nOur teams recovered the body, transferred it to Jarabulus Hospital, and secured the area from war remnants.\n#WhiteHelmets #Syria4:48 PM · Feb 25, 20255KViews15354"
